@PTruequeU_HostAddress = http://localhost:5088

### Register a new user
POST {{PTruequeU_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Test User",
  "email": "test@truequeu.edu",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "program": "Ingeniería Web"
}

### Login
POST {{PTruequeU_HostAddress}}/api/Auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "carlos.martinez@truequeu.edu",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Get all listings
GET {{PTruequeU_HostAddress}}/api/Listings
Accept: application/json

### Search listings by keyword
GET {{PTruequeU_HostAddress}}/api/Listings?Keyword=laptop
Accept: application/json

### Get categories
GET {{PTruequeU_HostAddress}}/api/Categories
Accept: application/json

###
